1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,854
Learn the vocabulary, because it is examined on its own.

2
00:00:03,854 --> 00:00:07,356
The titrant is the standard solution in the burette.

3
00:00:07,356 --> 00:00:12,005
The analyte, or titrate, is the unknown in the flask.

4
00:00:12,005 --> 00:00:17,369
And an aliquot is the measured portion of the unknown that the pipette delivers.

